<form class="form-horizontal">
    <div class="alert alert-info">
        <strong>Restart required after installation or update.</strong>
        OctoPrint must restart before the RME serial hooks, navbar, API, and background services are fully initialized. Plugin Manager and Software Update will prompt for this automatically.
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Plugin status</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <span class="label" data-bind="css: connectionClass, text: connectionText"></span>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: discover, enable: loginState.isUser">Detect RME firmware</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: showRmeTab">Open RME controls</button>
            <p class="help-block">The RME item in OctoPrint's top bar confirms that the browser integration loaded. It remains visible while disconnected or unsupported and expands with live tool/MMU data after discovery.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Protocol session</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.auto_open_session"> Open automatically after connection</label>
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.legacy_notifications"> Keep legacy action notifications alongside structured events</label>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: openSession, enable: state().supported">Reconnect protocol now</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Machine profile</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.auto_machine_profile"> Update volume, tools and motion speeds from the printer</label>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: applyMachineProfile, enable: hasMachine">Apply reported profile now</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Print-start mapping</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.prompt_toolmap_on_print"> Hold each multi-tool print until a tool mapping is confirmed</label>
            <label>Keep current mapping after <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="86400" data-bind="value: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.toolmap_timeout_seconds"> seconds untouched</label>
            <p class="help-block">The chosen mapping is saved as the default. Disabling the prompt applies that default automatically.</p>
            <p class="help-block">Use 0 for no timeout. The timer pauses permanently for that print as soon as the operator interacts with the mapping prompt.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Filament inventory</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.spoolmanager_enabled"> Synchronize firmware load choices and inventory selections</label>
            <label>Provider
                <select data-bind="value: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.spool_provider">
                    <option value="auto">Automatic (SpoolManager, Spoolman, then built-in)</option>
                    <option value="spoolmanager">SpoolManager</option>
                    <option value="spoolman">Spoolman</option>
                    <option value="internal">Built-in persistent inventory</option>
                </select>
            </label>
            <label>Reconcile every <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="10" data-bind="value: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.spoolmanager_sync_interval"> seconds</label>
            <label>Default new-spool weight <input class="input-small" type="number" min="1" data-bind="value: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.spoolmanager_default_weight"> g</label>
            <p>
                <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: syncFilamentsFromPrinter, enable: state().supported">Printer → provider</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: syncFilamentsToPrinter, enable: state().supported">Provider → printer</button>
            </p>
            <div class="alert alert-warning" data-bind="visible: pendingProviderSync">
                <strong>Filament provider changed.</strong>
                <span data-bind="text: pendingProviderSync() && pendingProviderSync().message"></span>
                <p>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: confirmProviderSync">Apply to printer</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: cancelProviderSync">Keep printer selections</button>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="form-inline">
                <label>Create/assign for tool <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" data-bind="value: newSpoolTool"></label>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: beginNewSpool">Add spool…</button>
            </div>
            <ul data-bind="foreach: publishedSpools">
                <li><span class="rme-color-dot" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: color}"></span> <span data-bind="text: $parent.spoolLabel($data)"></span></li>
            </ul>
            <table class="table table-condensed" data-bind="visible: spoolSelectionRows().length">
                <thead><tr><th>Printer tool</th><th>Selected spool</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody data-bind="foreach: spoolSelectionRows"><tr>
                    <td data-bind="text: 'T' + tool"></td>
                    <td><select data-bind="options: $parent.inventorySpools, optionsText: $parent.spoolLabel, optionsValue: 'database_id', optionsCaption: 'Unassigned', value: selected, event: {change: function() { $parent.changeSpoolSelection($data); }}"></select></td>
                </tr></tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="alert alert-info" data-bind="visible: pendingNewSpool">
                <strong>Configure new printer filament</strong>
                <p>Tool <span data-bind="text: pendingNewSpool() && pendingNewSpool().tool"></span>; this draft persists across refreshes.</p>
                <div class="form-inline rme-spool-form">
                    <label>Name <input class="input-medium" data-bind="value: newSpoolName"></label>
                    <label>Vendor <input class="input-small" data-bind="value: newSpoolVendor"></label>
                    <label>Material <input class="input-small" data-bind="value: newSpoolMaterial"></label>
                    <label>Color <input type="color" data-bind="value: newSpoolColor"></label>
                    <label>Color name <input class="input-small" data-bind="value: newSpoolColorName"></label>
                    <label>Initial weight <input class="input-small" type="number" min="1" data-bind="value: newSpoolWeight"> g</label>
                    <label>Nozzle <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: newSpoolNozzle"> °C</label>
                    <label>Bed <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: newSpoolBed"> °C</label>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: createSpool">Create, select, and sync</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: cancelNewSpool">Dismiss</button>
            </div>
            <p class="help-block">Seven firmware user slots mirror available spools; the eighth is reserved for NEW. External providers are exclusive: the built-in inventory is disabled while SpoolManager or Spoolman is active. Automatic uses built-in only when neither is available.</p>
            <p class="help-block">OrcaSlicer can poll <code>/plugin/rme_compatibility/selected-spools</code> or <code>/plugin/rme_compatibility/filament-report</code> with an OctoPrint API key.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">RME statistics</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <label>Poll supported firmware every <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="10" data-bind="value: settings.settings.plugins.rme_compatibility.stats_poll_interval"> seconds</label>
            <p class="help-block">The plugin probes once per connection and only continues polling after the firmware returns an RME_STATS, RME_STATS_OPERATIONS, or RME_STATS_FAILURES record.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <h4>Printer USB storage</h4>
    <p>Browse and manage the firmware-exported <code>/usb</code> volume. RME confines every operation to this user-visible storage root.</p>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Current directory</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <code data-bind="text: storage().path || '/'"></code>
            <span class="label" data-bind="css: {'label-success': storage().supported, 'label-warning': !storage().supported}, text: storageStatus"></span>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: refreshStorage, enable: state().supported">Refresh</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: storageParent, visible: storageParentVisible">Up</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: storageMkdir, enable: storage().supported">New folder…</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Upload</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="file" data-bind="event: {change: chooseStorageUpload}">
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: uploadStorage, enable: pendingStorageUpload">Upload to current directory</button>
            <p class="help-block">Uploads use contiguous 48-byte chunks, SHA-256 verification, and an atomic <code>.rme-part</code> rename.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <table class="table table-condensed rme-storage-table" data-bind="visible: storage().supported">
        <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type/size</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody data-bind="foreach: storageEntries"><tr>
            <td>
                <a href="#" data-bind="visible: type === 'dir', text: name, click: $parent.storageOpen"></a>
                <span data-bind="visible: type !== 'dir', text: name"></span>
            </td>
            <td data-bind="text: $parent.storageFileSize($data)"></td>
            <td>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="visible: type === 'file', click: $parent.storageDownload">Download</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="visible: $parent.storageCanPrint($data), click: $parent.storagePrint">Print…</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini btn-danger" data-bind="visible: $parent.storageCanFlash($data), click: $parent.storageFlash">Flash…</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: $parent.storageRename">Rename…</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini btn-danger" data-bind="click: $parent.storageDelete">Delete…</button>
            </td>
        </tr></tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="help-block" data-bind="visible: storage().supported && !storageEntries().length">This directory is empty.</p>
    <hr>
    <h4>Printer settings</h4>
    <p>These controls edit settings exposed by the connected RME firmware. Changes are queried back from the printer after saving.</p>
    <p>
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: queryControls, enable: state().supported">Refresh from printer</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: function() { uiControl('ENCODER', -1); }">Encoder −</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: function() { uiControl('CLICK', 0); }">Click</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: function() { uiControl('ENCODER', 1); }">Encoder +</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: function() { uiControl('BACK', 0); }">Back</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-bind="click: function() { uiControl('HOME', 0); }">Home</button>
    </p>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Current theme</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <span data-bind="visible: !currentThemeRows().length">Not reported yet</span>
            <span class="rme-theme-row" data-bind="foreach: currentThemeRows">
                <span class="rme-theme-current">
                    <span class="rme-theme-swatch" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: color}, attr: {title: label + ' ' + color}"></span>
                    <span data-bind="text: label + ' ' + color"></span>
                </span>
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Theme presets</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <div class="rme-theme-presets" data-bind="foreach: themePresets">
                <button type="button" class="btn rme-theme-preset" data-bind="click: $parent.selectThemePreset, attr: {title: 'Use ' + name}">
                    <strong data-bind="text: name"></strong>
                    <span class="rme-preset-swatches" data-bind="foreach: swatches">
                        <span data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: $data}"></span>
                    </span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <p class="help-block">Choose a preset to fill the editable firmware colors below. RME Indigo matches the firmware's bundled theme example.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group rme-theme-edit-group">
        <label class="control-label">Edit theme</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <span class="rme-theme-fields" data-bind="foreach: themeKeys">
                <label class="rme-color-field">
                    <span data-bind="text: label"></span>
                    <span class="rme-theme-editor">
                        <input type="color" data-bind="value: value">
                        <span class="rme-theme-swatch" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: value}, attr: {title: label + ' ' + value()}"></span>
                    </span>
                    <code data-bind="text: value"></code>
                </label>
            </span>
            <div class="rme-theme-save">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: applyTheme, enable: state().supported">Save theme to printer</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Printer lock</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <p><strong data-bind="text: lockSummary"></strong></p>
            <label>New/current PIN <input class="input-small" type="password" inputmode="numeric" minlength="4" maxlength="9" data-bind="value: lockPinConfig"></label>
            <label>Auto-lock timeout <input class="input-small" type="number" min="0" max="65535" data-bind="value: lockTimeout"> seconds</label>
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: lockSerial"> Permit serial unlock</label>
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: lockEnabled"> Enable persistent lock</label>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: applyLockSettings, enable: state().supported">Save lock settings</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: lockNow, enable: state().supported">Lock now</button>
            <input class="input-small" type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="9" placeholder="Unlock PIN" data-bind="value: unlockPin">
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: unlock, enable: state().supported">Unlock now</button>
            <p class="help-block">The firmware never reports the PIN. Enter it when saving lock settings.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Print lighting</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <p data-bind="text: currentLightsText"></p>
            <label>Screen <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: lightScreen">%</label>
            <label>Chamber <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: lightChamber">%</label>
            <label>Status <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: lightStatus">%</label>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: applyLights, enable: state().supported">Apply temporary print values</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Saved lighting</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <table class="table table-condensed rme-light-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Light</th><th>Deep idle</th><th>Idle</th><th>Active</th><th>Printing</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody data-bind="foreach: persistentLightProfiles"><tr>
                    <th data-bind="text: label"></th>
                    <td><input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: deepIdle">%</td>
                    <td><input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: idle">%</td>
                    <td><input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: active">%</td>
                    <td><input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="100" data-bind="value: printing">%</td>
                </tr></tbody>
            </table>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: applyPersistentLights, enable: state().supported">Save lighting profiles</button>
            <p class="help-block">The current firmware reports live print brightness but not the complete saved four-state matrix. Review all draft values before saving.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">User filament preset</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <label>Slot <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="7" data-bind="value: filamentSlot"></label>
            <label>Name <input class="input-small" maxlength="7" data-bind="value: filamentName"></label>
            <label>Nozzle <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: filamentNozzle"> °C</label>
            <label>Preheat <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: filamentPreheat"> °C</label>
            <label>Bed <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: filamentBed"> °C</label>
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: filamentVisible"> Visible</label>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: applyFilament, enable: state().supported">Save preset to printer</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <h4>Firmware update</h4>
    <p>Upload a signed BBF to this Pi, transfer and verify it through the RME binary protocol, then explicitly start the printer bootloader.</p>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Upload to Pi</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="file" accept=".bbf" data-bind="event: {change: chooseUpload}">
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: uploadToPi, enable: pendingUpload">Upload to Pi</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Firmware on Pi</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <select data-bind="options: firmwareFiles, optionsText: firmwareLabel, optionsValue: 'name', value: selectedFirmware, optionsCaption: 'Choose firmware on Pi'"></select>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: stageFirmware, enable: canStage">Stage on printer</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" data-bind="click: stageAndFlashFirmware, enable: canStage">Stage and flash…</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" data-bind="click: flashFirmware, enable: canFlash">Flash and reboot…</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: deleteFirmware, enable: selectedFirmware() && !firmwareBusy()">Delete from Pi…</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: cancelFirmware, visible: firmwareBusy">Cancel transfer</button>
            <div class="progress" data-bind="visible: firmwareActive">
                <div class="bar" data-bind="style: {width: firmwareProgress}"></div>
            </div>
            <p data-bind="text: firmwareStatus"></p>
            <div class="alert alert-error" data-bind="visible: firmwareError, text: firmwareError"></div>
            <p class="help-block">Delete from Pi removes the selected uploaded BBF. To remove a BBF already on the printer, use Delete in the Printer USB storage browser above.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
